1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
The world's longest sea crossing runs 55 km.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,400
It links Hong Kong, Zhuhai and Macau.

4
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,200
Halfway across, the road vanishes underwater.

5
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,000
A 6.7 km tunnel dives so ships pass overhead.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,600
Two artificial islands stitch bridge to tunnel.

7
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,200
Double-tap if you'd drive across the sea.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:21,600
★ Expert Tip: no private cars — take the cross-border shuttle bus.

9
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:24,600
Bridge or tunnel — which half would you film? Tell me.
